[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_n1lec")
titel = "Dwarfs"
description = "Dwarfs are a stout and hardy people who live mostly underground, deep within the flanks of the World Seam Mountains.

They are an isolated people and generally keep to their mountain homes. Although nominally allied with the Empire, this alliance mostly consists of resource trade and a limited exchange of information.

Only the most adventurous dwarfs venture out into the wider world, usually as mercenaries or merchants.

Much like halflings, dwarfs do not fit neatly into the distinction between tall-folk, wild-folk, and beast-folk. They are clearly civilized like tall-folk, yet overwhelmingly male like wild-folk. However, they practise no form of slavery, instead relying upon their long lifespans and small female population to sustain their numbers. This creates the curious situation that the stout dwarfs are generally classified as tall-folk."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bkxhc74auednr"
